<title>MACAU: Macau 1996 inflation rate 4.8 percent.</title>
<headline>Macau 1996 inflation rate 4.8 percent.</headline>
<dateline>MACAU 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Macau's composite consumer price index (CCPI) rose 4.8 percent in 1996 on the previous year, the Statistics and Census Department said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The inflation rate for 1995 stood at 8.6 pecent.</p>
<p>The CCPI, which averages expenditure patterns of various income groups excluding housing rents, grew 4.7 percent last December on the year-ago period.</p>
<p>It rose 0.1 percentage points from November to December last year.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
